    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Turkish graphic designer and art director based in London; BA Central Saint Martins 2018. Practice is language-led: treats words as objects, performers and places (profiled by It's Nice That); no-fuss, text-based, conceptual graphic and identity work. Currently a designer at Zak Group (London studio), confirmed by the studio's own people page and press. Seniority: mid-weight designer, ~6 yrs since graduating; Autonomy 3 estimate (studio designer, capable on projects but not running a practice), hedged. Work Status Employed: Zak Group's site lists her on the team and It's Nice That corroborates; no LinkedIn found. IG @aseltambay verified (bio Big fan of the alphabet, graphic-design grid). Jonathan's clip note ex Partner-Dream kept in Open Questions for him to clarify; could not confirm a Dream studio link.",
